{"4476070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrophobia", "steam_appid": 4476070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4878210], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrophobia is  heavily inspired by the novella <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> by H. P. Lovecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.poster.avif?t=1786826909\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.webm?t=1786826909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.mp4?t=1786826909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2001, astronauts Ben Dyer (the player) and Henry Danforth are sent to the Moon as part of a secret mission, Project Kadath, to study ancient megalithic architecture far older than humanity. The civilization that built it did not survive, but something else did.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is a slow-burn and narrative-focused experience</u></strong> told through character dialogue and environmental storytelling. The plot will unfold throughout multiple set-pieces and locations, such as the moon base, the moon's surface, and the monolithic city beneath the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive PSX-era aesthetics, including affine warping, vertex snapping, distance culling, pixelated textures, and low-poly models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay centered on finding key items to progress through the story, enhanced by unique set pieces and locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional CRT VFX for even more retro vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrific monsters based on Lovecraft's deep mythos and creature design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Low gravity hops, obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Average playtime is 45-60 minutes depending on your pace. You may get even more playtime if you are trying to 100% the achievements! <br><br><i><strong>NOTE: </strong></i>Astrophobia is best experienced in one sitting. However, there is an automatic save feature that activates at the beginning of each level, incase you need it.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrophobia is  heavily inspired by the novella <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> by H. P. Lovecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.poster.avif?t=1786826909\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.webm?t=1786826909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/extras/89dada4afa9ac928a5ddd0386828d7d3.mp4?t=1786826909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2001, astronauts Ben Dyer (the player) and Henry Danforth are sent to the Moon as part of a secret mission, Project Kadath, to study ancient megalithic architecture far older than humanity. The civilization that built it did not survive, but something else did.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is a slow-burn and narrative-focused experience</u></strong> told through character dialogue and environmental storytelling. The plot will unfold throughout multiple set-pieces and locations, such as the moon base, the moon's surface, and the monolithic city beneath the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive PSX-era aesthetics, including affine warping, vertex snapping, distance culling, pixelated textures, and low-poly models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay centered on finding key items to progress through the story, enhanced by unique set pieces and locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional CRT VFX for even more retro vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrific monsters based on Lovecraft's deep mythos and creature design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Low gravity hops, obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Average playtime is 45-60 minutes depending on your pace. You may get even more playtime if you are trying to 100% the achievements! <br><br><i><strong>NOTE: </strong></i>Astrophobia is best experienced in one sitting. However, there is an automatic save feature that activates at the beginning of each level, incase you need it.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A PSX-style cosmic horror game where a classified mission to study alien architecture on the Moon leads two astronauts into the ruins of an ancient civilization that predates humanity.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/bcaac8bba1408e9cc4b63f1d4a22b68b777ffee3/header.jpg?t=1786826909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476070/d92e2dd1d5a6e093